Relicensed source (authorized)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The rolling-window scorer and its tests were extracted from the Open Agentic
Platform (OAP), `crates/policy-kernel/coherence.rs` (the `CoherenceScheduler`),
where they carry an SPDX header reading `AGPL-3.0-or-later`. Relicensing this
extracted source to Apache-2.0 is the prerogative of the sole copyright holder
(Bartek Kus) and is an explicit, authorized act.

The extraction is domain-neutral by construction: OAP's `coherence.rs` was
already free of Open Agentic Platform domain terms (zero coupling hits). The
generalization added on extraction (weighted samples instead of booleans,
configurable direction instead of a hardcoded degrade-only latch, and a
snapshot seam for durable persistence) carries no OAP semantics either.

A forthcoming OAP extraction spec (analogous to spec 219 for tenant-tail)
formalizes the vend; the interim record is
`chancery/docs/preliminary/00-extraction-overview.md` and `03-trust-window.md`.
